# App keep rules (AGP 9 keepRules source folder, .keep extension required; applied when release minification runs).
#
# Deliberately minimal: DI is a hand-written composition root (no reflection), serialization
# uses compile-time kotlinx serializers, and every library in use (kotlinx.serialization, OkHttp,
# Coil, GMS Maps/Places, ML Kit, Play Review) ships its own consumer rules. Add rules here only
# with a reproduced failure in hand — a rule without a failing stack is cargo cult.

# Readable release stack traces: keep line numbers, hide the original file name.
-keepattributes SourceFile,LineNumberTable
-renamesourcefileattribute SourceFile

# Reproduced R8 failure (first minified build, 2026-08-16): play review-ktx 2.0.2 references this
# GMS *annotation* that no artifact on our classpath ships. Annotations are metadata, absent ones
# change nothing at runtime — suppress, don't add a dependency for it.
-dontwarn com.google.android.gms.common.annotation.NoNullnessRewrite
